## Configuration Package Overview
Configuration management for go-skeleton.

## Configuration Sections
- Server: Mode, port, base keys
- Database: MySQL connections
- Cache: Redis configuration
- Auth: JWT settings
- WebRTC: STUN/TURN servers (if applicable)

## Important Notes
When modifying configuration:
1. Update both TOML and Go code
2. Validate all settings
3. Document new configuration options
